check::two_way_prop

  × `color` cannot be bound two-way
    ╭─[one_mistake.strand:13:23]
 12 │     on click { prefs.b = 1 }
 13 │     text "a" { color: <-> s }
    ·                       ─┬─
    ·                        ╰── the element never writes it
 14 │   }
    ╰────
  help: `<->` is for props a widget writes back: `value`, `text`, `open`, `current`; bind this one
        with `name: value`

